      <title>Monday Walking Group       at Front of Blackburn building</title>
      <description><![CDATA[<div>  <img src="https://localist-images.azureedge.net/photos/54540876950552/huge/dc34169e18a83969878827d5dc8cfe6e68dd2b34.jpg" style="width: 100%;" />  <div style="font-size: 0.9em; color: #555;"><strong>Mon, 23 Nov 2026</strong></div>  <div><p>All staff and faculty are invited to join the in-person walking group, led by Howard University Wellness Champion, Alisha McDougal, and supported by the HR Wellness and Benefits team. Participants gather at the flagpole in front of Blackburn and walk together in a shady area around campus.  Please bring your walking shoes, water, and be ready for laughter and connection. </p>

<p> </p>

<p>For more information, contact Alisha McDougal at  <a href="mailto:Alisha.McDougal@Howard.edu">Alisha.McDougal@Howard.edu</a> or Onsite Health Coach, Katherine Smith, at <a href="mailto:Katherine.Smith@Evernorth.com">Katherine.Smith@Evernorth.com</a>.</p>

