      <title>Mindful Monday Webinar: The Gratitude Hour: Pause, Appreciate, Practice</title>
      <description><![CDATA[<div>  <img src="https://localist-images.azureedge.net/photos/54540897049848/huge/c97d031d81569718c89f38c466304859469cc307.jpg" style="width: 100%;" />  <div style="font-size: 0.9em; color: #555;"><strong>Mon, 23 Nov 2026</strong></div>  <div><p>Take an hour to pause from the demands of the day and intentionally focus on gratitude. In this interactive one-hour webinar, participants will explore how gratitude can support well-being. Through guided reflection, simple exercises, and practical activities, participants will have opportunities to:</p>

<p> </p>

<p>Pause and create space to notice what is going well.Appreciate the people, experiences, and everyday moments that are meaningful to them.Practice simple gratitude techniques that can become part of their daily routine. </p>

<p>Participants are encouraged to bring a notebook or something to write with.</p>

