      <title>Rev. Eugene Burrell Annual Thanksgiving Dinner  at Bethune Annex Cafe</title>
      <description><![CDATA[<div>  <img src="https://localist-images.azureedge.net/photos/54549953225908/huge/a7da896c0b7b22e45d0ee94a93294f54608f0986.jpg" style="width: 100%;" />  <div style="font-size: 0.9em; color: #555;"><strong>Thu, 26 Nov 2026</strong></div>  <div><p>On behalf of the Office of the Dean of the Chapel and the Division of Student Affairs, we want to extend a warm invitation for students to join us for a Thanksgiving Dinner as we come together for food, fellowship, and community.</p>

<p>Dinner will be served on Thursday, November 26, 2026 from 12:30 p.m. until 2:30 p.m. in the Bethune Annex Cafeteria and is offered at no cost to students.</p>

